        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">objective and independent assurance, e.g. internal audit, providing reasonable (not absolute) assurance of the overall effectiveness of governance, risk management and controls.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/hseErmControlOntology#"/>
